    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord</h1><p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/d114407b877b8a7d96801723fda6b398.avif?t=1667136934\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be the Balance Breakers!</strong></h2>Pick your Breakers, fight against enemies and bosses, collect treasures to claim the victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2v2 - Team Battle</strong></h2>Team up as 2 to fight the opponent, raid treasures and throw orbs for the win.<br><br>Matches are held on maps with the boss, casting dangerous skills to knock everyone off!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/2fa4e6209e5c5f0a1062ed2239f0f388.poster.avif?t=1667136934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/2fa4e6209e5c5f0a1062ed2239f0f388.webm?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/2fa4e6209e5c5f0a1062ed2239f0f388.mp4?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free for all - Rumble Arena</strong></h2>Battle royale is needed for the party! Just fight for yourself in the battleground!<br><br>Plan the strategy on maps with special mechanics, keep the most treasures until the end.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/c3ae41446c9e70cc5d114e461dfb4fe0.poster.avif?t=1667136934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/c3ae41446c9e70cc5d114e461dfb4fe0.webm?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/c3ae41446c9e70cc5d114e461dfb4fe0.mp4?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A party battle game for everyone</strong></h2>Breakers with special dash skill are easy to learn, choose your fighters based on play styles.<br><br>Wombo combo with other breakers to kick other opponents away from the victory.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/172ad6afede5ddf6192e2a8393e5bab3.poster.avif?t=1667136934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/172ad6afede5ddf6192e2a8393e5bab3.webm?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/172ad6afede5ddf6192e2a8393e5bab3.mp4?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fancy graphics come with epic battles<br></li><li>Simple to control, easy to learn and fun to watch<br></li><li>Breakers casting special Dash Skills can be chosen each game<br></li><li>Grand Tournament: Race to 20 points to see who are the best player in the party<br></li><li>Grand Tournament includes classic Team Battle and Rumble Arena matches<br></li><li>Team Battle Mode: the classic 2v2 team fight<br></li><li>Team Battle maps include boss with unique skills and ultimate<br></li><li>Rumble Arena Mode: the free for all chaotic battle<br></li><li>Rumble Arena maps include different mechanics and special winning methods<br></li><li>Party Mode: Special gameplay mode to spice up the party<br></li><li>Party Mode includes \u201cFast Forward\u201d, \u201cOne Punch\u201d, \u201cTreasure Room\u201d and \u201cChess\u201d modes<br></li><li><strong>Extra Bonus in game: a 10 minutes intro animation!</strong></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/4b3c83c7728c61ef0a305a9260ae09f3.avif?t=1667136934\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be the Balance Breakers!</strong></h2>Pick your Breakers, fight against enemies and bosses, collect treasures to claim the victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2v2 - Team Battle</strong></h2>Team up as 2 to fight the opponent, raid treasures and throw orbs for the win.<br><br>Matches are held on maps with the boss, casting dangerous skills to knock everyone off!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/2fa4e6209e5c5f0a1062ed2239f0f388.poster.avif?t=1667136934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/2fa4e6209e5c5f0a1062ed2239f0f388.webm?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/2fa4e6209e5c5f0a1062ed2239f0f388.mp4?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free for all - Rumble Arena</strong></h2>Battle royale is needed for the party! Just fight for yourself in the battleground!<br><br>Plan the strategy on maps with special mechanics, keep the most treasures until the end.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/c3ae41446c9e70cc5d114e461dfb4fe0.poster.avif?t=1667136934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/c3ae41446c9e70cc5d114e461dfb4fe0.webm?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/c3ae41446c9e70cc5d114e461dfb4fe0.mp4?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A party battle game for everyone</strong></h2>Breakers with special dash skill are easy to learn, choose your fighters based on play styles.<br><br>Wombo combo with other breakers to kick other opponents away from the victory.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/172ad6afede5ddf6192e2a8393e5bab3.poster.avif?t=1667136934\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/172ad6afede5ddf6192e2a8393e5bab3.webm?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/172ad6afede5ddf6192e2a8393e5bab3.mp4?t=1667136934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fancy graphics come with epic battles<br></li><li>Simple to control, easy to learn and fun to watch<br></li><li>Breakers casting special Dash Skills can be chosen each game<br></li><li>Grand Tournament: Race to 20 points to see who are the best player in the party<br></li><li>Grand Tournament includes classic Team Battle and Rumble Arena matches<br></li><li>Team Battle Mode: the classic 2v2 team fight<br></li><li>Team Battle maps include boss with unique skills and ultimate<br></li><li>Rumble Arena Mode: the free for all chaotic battle<br></li><li>Rumble Arena maps include different mechanics and special winning methods<br></li><li>Party Mode: Special gameplay mode to spice up the party<br></li><li>Party Mode includes \u201cFast Forward\u201d, \u201cOne Punch\u201d, \u201cTreasure Room\u201d and \u201cChess\u201d modes<br></li><li><strong>Extra Bonus in game: a 10 minutes intro animation!</strong></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1069750/extras/4b3c83c7728c61ef0a305a9260ae09f3.avif?t=1667136934\" /></div>",
